{"duration": 71.65, "segments": [{"scene": "hook", "text": "¿Es obligatorio pagar la cuota del patronato? Esta pregunta divide a muchas colonias.", "pause": 0.35, "start": 0.4, "end": 5.5, "words": [{"w": "Es", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.58}, {"w": "obligatorio", "s": 0.58, "e": 1.2}, {"w": "pagar", "s": 1.2, "e": 1.5}, {"w": "la", "s": 1.5, "e": 1.74}, {"w": "cuota", "s": 1.74, "e": 2.06}, {"w": "del", "s": 2.06, "e": 2.18}, {"w": "patronato,", "s": 2.18, "e": 2.8}, {"w": "esta", "s": 3.08, "e": 3.34}, {"w": "pregunta", "s": 3.34, "e": 3.72}, {"w": "divide", "s": 3.72, "e": 4.16}, {"w": "a", "s": 4.16, "e": 4.4}, {"w": "muchas", "s": 4.4, "e": 4.62}, {"w": "colonias.", "s": 4.62, "e": 5.22}]}, {"scene": "rosa", "text": "Doña Rosa es la tesorera del patronato. Cada mes cobra cien lempiras para el alumbrado y la vigilancia.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 5.85, "end": 12.01, "words": [{"w": "Doña", "s": 5.85, "e": 6.17}, {"w": "Rosa", "s": 6.17, "e": 6.49}, {"w": "es", "s": 6.49, "e": 6.89}, {"w": "la", "s": 6.89, "e": 7.03}, {"w": "tesorera", "s": 7.03, "e": 7.53}, {"w": "del", "s": 7.53, "e": 7.67}, {"w": "patronato.", "s": 7.67, "e": 8.31}, {"w": "Cada", "s": 8.55, "e": 8.75}, {"w": "mes", "s": 8.75, "e": 8.97}, {"w": "cobra", "s": 8.97, "e": 9.27}, {"w": "100", "s": 9.27, "e": 9.51}, {"w": "lempiras", "s": 9.51, "e": 10.11}, {"w": "para", "s": 10.11, "e": 10.29}, {"w": "el", "s": 10.29, "e": 10.41}, {"w": "alumbrado", "s": 10.41, "e": 10.95}, {"w": "y", "s": 10.95, "e": 11.15}, {"w": "la", "s": 11.15, "e": 11.25}, {"w": "vigilancia.", "s": 11.25, "e": 11.87}]}, {"scene": "puerta", "text": "Pero don Mario le cierra la puerta:", "pause": 0.15, "start": 12.31, "end": 14.79, "words": [{"w": "Pero", "s": 12.31, "e": 12.51}, {"w": "Don", "s": 12.51, "e": 12.79}, {"w": "Mario", "s": 12.79, "e": 13.31}, {"w": "le", "s": 13.31, "e": 13.55}, {"w": "cierra", "s": 13.55, "e": 13.95}, {"w": "la", "s": 13.95, "e": 14.11}, {"w": "puerta.", "s": 14.11, "e": 14.33}]}, {"scene": "puerta", "who": "mario", "voice": "em_santa", "text": "¡Yo no pago! Nunca nos dicen en qué gastan la plata.", "pause": 0.3, "start": 14.94, "end": 17.86, "words": [{"w": "Yo", "s": 14.94, "e": 15.12}, {"w": "no", "s": 15.12, "e": 15.3}, {"w": "pago,", "s": 15.3, "e": 15.68}, {"w": "nunca", "s": 15.84, "e": 16.08}, {"w": "nos", "s": 16.08, "e": 16.32}, {"w": "dicen", "s": 16.32, "e": 16.62}, {"w": "en", "s": 16.62, "e": 16.78}, {"w": "que", "s": 16.78, "e": 16.88}, {"w": "gastan", "s": 16.88, "e": 17.3}, {"w": "la", "s": 17.3, "e": 17.4}, {"w": "plata.", "s": 17.4, "e": 17.6}]}, {"scene": "luces", "text": "Y doña Rosa le responde:", "pause": 0.15, "start": 18.16, "end": 20.08, "words": [{"w": "y", "s": 18.16, "e": 18.34}, {"w": "Doña", "s": 18.34, "e": 18.72}, {"w": "Rosa", "s": 18.72, "e": 19.02}, {"w": "le", "s": 19.02, "e": 19.24}, {"w": "responde.", "s": 19.24, "e": 19.9}]}, {"scene": "luces", "who": "rosa", "voice": "ef_dora", "text": "Si nadie paga, no hay luz en las calles, ni vigilancia.", "pause": 0.35, "start": 20.23, "end": 23.39, "words": [{"w": "Si", "s": 20.23, "e": 20.37}, {"w": "nadie", "s": 20.37, "e": 20.59}, {"w": "paga,", "s": 20.59, "e": 21.03}, {"w": "no", "s": 21.23, "e": 21.33}, {"w": "hay", "s": 21.33, "e": 21.45}, {"w": "luz", "s": 21.45, "e": 21.63}, {"w": "en", "s": 21.63, "e": 21.77}, {"w": "las", "s": 21.77, "e": 21.89}, {"w": "calles", "s": 21.89, "e": 22.37}, {"w": "ni", "s": 22.37, "e": 22.49}, {"w": "vigilancia.", "s": 22.49, "e": 23.15}]}, {"scene": "lados", "text": "¿Quién tiene la razón?", "pause": 0.2, "start": 23.74, "end": 25.27, "words": [{"w": "¿Quién", "s": 23.74, "e": 24.02}, {"w": "tiene", "s": 24.02, "e": 24.32}, {"w": "la", "s": 24.32, "e": 24.52}, {"w": "razón?", "s": 24.52, "e": 24.84}]}, {"scene": "ladoR", "text": "Ella necesita fondos para mejorar la colonia.", "pause": 0.2, "start": 25.47, "end": 28.34, "words": [{"w": "Ella", "s": 25.47, "e": 25.73}, {"w": "necesita", "s": 25.73, "e": 26.19}, {"w": "fondos", "s": 26.19, "e": 26.89}